          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "text_e07AbHQ4",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 60,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 70,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 32px;\"><strong>什么是Python？</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1a1a1a",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_LZrKXOtg",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 170,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 232,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>语言特性</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Python 是一种解释型、面向对象的高级编程语言，具有动态类型和自动内存管理特性。</p><p style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>应用领域</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">广泛应用于数据分析（pandas、NumPy）、人工智能（TensorFlow、PyTorch）、Web 开发（Django、Flask）、爬虫等领域。</p><p style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>适合入门的原因</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">语法简洁，接近自然语言；代码易读易写；庞大的社区和丰富的学习资源。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_8jDwdv-z",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_e07AbHQ4"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_OX_Siodb",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "大家好，欢迎来到Python编程课！我是你们的老师，星野。今天我们要认识一个非常有趣又强大的语言——Python。Python就像是编程世界里的“万能小助手”，简单、易学，却又威力无穷。有没有同学听说过它呢？让我们先来看看大屏幕。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_txdtLHCI",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_LZrKXOtg"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_SwEg9ILM",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "首先，Python是一种解释型、面向对象的高级编程语言，拥有动态类型和自动内存管理。通俗来说，我们写Python代码时，不需要像一些语言那样先编译再运行，解释器会直接一行行读我们的代码执行。面向对象则让我们可以用更贴近真实世界的方式来组织程序。而动态类型和自动内存管理，更是帮我们省去了很多繁杂的底层细节，可以让我们把精力集中在解决问题本身上。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_bYmUlIaL",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_LZrKXOtg"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_r3OxrZgl",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "也正因为这些特性，Python的应用范围非常广泛。从数据分析、人工智能，到Web开发、自动化脚本，Python的身影无处不在。像Google、NASA、Netflix这些顶尖公司，都在大量使用Python。而且Python的语法格外简洁，可读性极高，几乎就像在写英文句子一样。正因为如此，它被公认为最理想的编程入门语言之一。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_TdvlSkWo",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_e07AbHQ4"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_f-NeLPtr",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "所以，无论你之前有没有接触过编程，都不必担心。Python会是你最温柔、最友好的伙伴。从这一节课开始，我会陪大家一起，一步步揭开Python的神秘面纱。那么，准备好开启这段奇妙的编程之旅了吗？"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780908658776,
      "updatedAt": 1780908658776
    },
    {
      "id": "scene__1wQW1O-cz",
      "stageId": "kvNBYr9upy",
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "Python基础语法",
      "order": 2,
      "content": {
        "type": "slide",
        "canvas": {
          "id": "pffDdrc_Rx5BwU1VxQUs6",
          "viewportSize": 1000,
          "viewportRatio": 0.5625,
          "theme": {
            "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
            "themeColors": [
              "#5b9bd5",
              "#ed7d31",
              "#a5a5a5",
              "#ffc000",
              "#4472c4"
            ],
            "fontColor": "#333333",
            "fontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
            "outline": {
              "color": "#d14424",
              "width": 2,
              "style": "solid"
            },
            "shadow": {
              "h": 0,
              "v": 0,
              "blur": 10,
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "text_YEvGC0C-",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 50,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 70,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 32px;\"><strong>Python变量与命名规则</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1a1a1a",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_Fkg0ipSm",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 150,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 58,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>变量命名规则</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#2b5797",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_X8kv-lbv",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 218,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 118,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• 大小写敏感，<strong>name</strong>和<strong>Name</strong>是不同的变量</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• 推荐小写字母加下划线，如<strong>user_name</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• 不能以数字开头，如<strong>1name</strong>不合法</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• 不能使用Python保留字，如<strong>class</strong>、<strong>def</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_hDzxNHdA",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 366,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 58,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>print() 输出变量</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#2b5797",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_o7v-_jBE",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 434,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 70,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• 语法：<strong>print(变量名)</strong> 将变量的值输出到屏幕</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• 示例：<strong>name = \"小明\"; print(name)</strong> → 显示 <strong>小明</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_pUc2k8u6",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_YEvGC0C-"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_SfOQS5DZ",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "接下来我们来学习Python的变量与命名规则。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_t2WX_s5m",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_Fkg0ipSm"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_SBPUL4UO",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "变量命名有一些重要的规则需要记住。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_1aDMRpZ3",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_X8kv-lbv"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_x0Doh6Ol",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "首先，Python变量是大小写敏感的，name和Name代表不同的变量。我们推荐使用小写字母加下划线的方式，例如user_name，这样命名清晰易读。同时要注意变量名不能以数字开头，也不能使用Python的保留关键字。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_ecz_56q7",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_hDzxNHdA"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_lsU5-MTO",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "定义好变量后，该怎么查看变量的内容呢？这就需要用到print()函数。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_85YjIZGT",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_o7v-_jBE"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_ObXrxP4B",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "print()的使用很简单，把变量名放在括号里就能输出到屏幕。比如我们设定name等于'小明'，那么print(name)就会显示出'小明'。"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780908658777,
      "updatedAt": 1780908658777
    },
