              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "shape_U5sT4CXt",
              "type": "shape",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 160,
              "width": 440,
              "height": 120,
              "path": "M 0 0 L 1 0 L 1 1 L 0 1 Z",
              "viewBox": [
                1,
                1
              ],
              "fill": "#f8f8f0",
              "fixedRatio": false,
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_FZAHPBy4",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 80,
              "top": 185,
              "width": 400,
              "height": 70,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:monospace;\">name = input('请输入你的名字：')</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:monospace;\">print('你好，' + name + '！欢迎学习Python！')</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_aaWiwShk",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 520,
              "top": 160,
              "width": 420,
              "height": 142,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>代码解析</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">• <strong>input()函数</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;获取用户输入，返回字符串</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">• <strong>变量赋值</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;将输入保存到 name 变量</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">• <strong>组合输出</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;print() 拼接字符串并显示欢迎信息</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_NZNyZaXY",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_7v2_3Pgp"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_piQJ1qRB",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "大家好，我是星野老师。欢迎来到Python编程入门课！今天我们一起编写你的第一个Python程序，感受代码的魅力。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_r_S4-GKk",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_FZAHPBy4"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_-VJBKiqD",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "看这段小程序，它只有两行，但已经可以和用户互动了——它会先问你的名字，然后对你说一声温暖的“你好”。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_KRDhCNpb",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_aaWiwShk"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_NzApX6fK",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "我们来一行行理解。input()函数负责显示提示语并等待你输入，你键入的内容会被存到name这个变量里。接着print()把固定的文字和name拼接起来，组成一句完整的问候。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_CUiph3HZ",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "这里的加号“+”不是做数学计算，而是把文字片段连接在一起，我们叫做字符串拼接。是不是很形象呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_GTh_s_68",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "等一下大家可以在自己的电脑上试着运行这个程序，把“你好”换成你喜欢的问候语，看看效果吧！"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780908658777,
